abstract-class.diagram:
classDiagram
  class Shape {
    <<abstract>>
    -String color
    +Shape(color)
    +area() double*
    +describe() String
  }
  class Circle {
    -double r
    +area() double
  }
  class Rectangle {
    -double w
    -double h
    +area() double
  }
  Shape <|-- Circle
  Shape <|-- Rectangle
  Client ..> Shape : 다형적 호출
